  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>WF-load_cdm
Loads the OMOP CDM 5.4 tables from ODS and map. First empties the clinical CDM tables,
restarts the event id sequences and empties adm.cdm_load_reject. The vocabulary is not touched.
care_site and person come first: the other tables point to them.</note>
